{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-12",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Draft only: compare the six schematic positions of y=ax^2+bx+c(a\\ne0) relative to the x-axis by the sign of a and D. Frozen current-template context: /Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/d9b1/lemmadeck/ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/8a/editions/modern-us-neutral/figures/evidence/fig-12/context.json; raw SHA-256 c26cfbef06ea2b42e38906a3eccb29d6426c68ee87af73f622b7e0e347a89dfc. Not finalized edition text or new SOURCE/math approval. Source facts: exactly three table rows including the header, four columns including the row-label band, one blank corner and six graph cells; solid unticked axes and solid finite schematic curves. Coordinates are approximate source-pixel layout with inverted y, not mathematical function units. Justified modern additions: straighten scan-skewed table borders and axes; regularize three approximately equal graph-column widths and two approximately equal data-row heights without equalizing the narrower label band or shorter header; clean semantic ink; explicit label anchors; finite piecewise-linear source-stroke samples; machine-addressable landmarks embedded inside existing strokes. Four finite grids encode content 3x2, header 3x1, labels 1x2 and blank corner 1x1 with explicit offsets, not an invented uniform 4x3 lattice. No unit ticks, coordinate labels, x1/x2 labels, shading, formulas for generic curves, answer annotations, endpoint arrows or extension. HOLD: exact stroke centerlines, axis contact pixels and finite terminals are manual estimates, with no renderer or visual approval; skew rectification and complete table/curve fidelity require later independent evidence. Printed n5 y=2x^4+4x-1 and p0027-math-1 blank correction remain unapproved and untouched.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/d9b1/lemmadeck/ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/8a/figures/fig-12.png",
      "sha256": "7e0115f1be3791467c96db5372b86ff1f6d5e945af3b0885c2b3fac0ac20a10d"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n6",
        "text": "函数$y=ax^2+bx+c(a\\ne0)$的图象相对于$x$轴的位置表示在图12中."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n6",
        "text": "图11"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n6",
        "text": "解二次不等式时，我们利用了关于二次函数的图象相对于$x$轴的位置的想法. 显然，这个位置由两个条件确定，就是二次三项式$ax^2+bx+c$的系数$a$的符号和判别式$D$的值. 抛物线“开口”的方向决定于系数$a$的符号，抛物线相对于$x$轴的位置（抛物线和$x$轴有两个公共点，只有一个公共点，没有公共点）决定于判别式$D$的符号."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n6",
        "text": "图12"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n6",
        "exercise": "51",
        "text": "51.\n1) 利用图12指出下列不等式的解集合（三项式的根用字母$x_1$和$x_2$表示）：\na) $ax^2+bx+c>0$，其中$a>0$，$D>0$；\nb) $ax^2+bx+c\\le0$，其中$a>0$，$D>0$。\n2) 利用图12指出下列不等式的解集合：\na) $ax^2+bx+c\\ge0$，其中$a<0$，$D<0$；\nb) $ax^2+bx+c<0$，其中$a<0$，$D<0$。"
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "source-table-lattice",
        "description": "Actual source has a closed, scan-skewed solid outer rectangle with three interior vertical dividers and two interior horizontal dividers: 4 columns x 3 rows, exactly 12 cells. Approximate original divider x positions are 160, 712 and 1264; top/bottom borders near y=25/1310, header bottom y=170 and data-row divider y=733. The first column is narrow and the header is shallow, not a regular unit grid. Draft rectified source-screen bounds are x=20..1810, y=30..1320; column boundaries 20,160,710,1260,1810 and row boundaries 30,180,750,1320. In inverted-y coordinates the four grids have absolute phases (160,20), (160,1160), (20,20), (20,1160). Their mapped dimensions preserve every cell, including blanks; no objectCount substitute.",
